\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Sensitivity of stapling to mid-session re-routes (simulated, $\bar  \lambda =2000$/s). Left: share of requests that wait for a root or signature. Right: root installs plus fetches per token (the prototype's miss definition). For pull this is the fetch count (1.0--2.4 per token), and it coincides with the staple-all curve. M2 and EMBER staple-first overlap almost exactly in both panels. The dotted line marks the default $p_{\text  {move}}=0.0005$.}}{8}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
